sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant T as Traefik
  participant P as project
  participant S as session (kernel + QueueWorker)
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant W as worker pod(s)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  B->>T: POST /api/projects {question}
  T->>P: route /api/projects
  P->>S: POST /internal/directory/start
  S->>DB: insert session, root task (depth 0)
  S->>S: budget check (billing slice in-process)
  S->>Q: publish turn on lumen.turns.0
  S-->>P: sessionId
  P-->>B: 201 {project, sessionId}
  B->>T: GET /ws (WebSocket)
  T->>S: route /ws
  Q->>W: deliver turn (prefetch = slots)
  W->>S: POST /internal/turns/:id/step (lead plans)
  S->>DB: insert step, add cost
  S-->>B: step event on /ws
  W->>S: POST /internal/turns/:id/delegate [3 readers]
  S->>DB: insert 3 child tasks (depth 1)
  S->>Q: publish 3 turns on lumen.turns.1
  Q->>W: deliver reader turns (any pod)
  W->>S: step, finding, spend (per reader)
  S-->>B: step and finding events
  W->>S: POST /internal/turns/:child/done
  W->>Q: ack reader turns
  S-->>W: delegate returns the children at rest
  W->>S: step (lead reply), POST done
  W->>Q: ack root turn
  S->>DB: root task status ended
  S-->>B: task ended event
